# Payload
media/
# The showroom's types are committed and CI diffs them against a fresh generation. The
# test application's are not: nothing there imports them. Anchored, so a future
# packages/*/payload-types.ts is not silently swallowed by a bare pattern.
/test/app/payload-types.ts

